From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:31:08 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 52/56] Plutonium: websocket tickets minted at the route-named
 path

The mobile app (upstream, ahead of this fork) mints its tickets at
/api/auth/websocket-ticket/<rpc|media> (upstream #24554) and got 404 here.
This server's tickets aren't bound to a route, so the new path issues the
same ticket as the bare one, which opens either route.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
